    "name": "VR Quiet Life",
    "steam_appid": 1404330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/09161c8545da972a42fdf8aa75b94839.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/1d9a96fdc2712da9439a52fcd82a5f49.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>Enjoy a freedom slow life in nature in VR space<br>Live in a log house, and play freely until it's time to go home<br>Enjoy catching insects, fishing, cooking and also communicating with your partner<br>What you can do will increase little by little as the day progresses<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/b58731428e3458637ca12112e18124d3.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>Items and creatures you bring back from exploration will be saved when you place them in your home.<br>You can grow vegetables by finding seeds, taking them home, and planting them in your farm.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/a789f4c49c7b8825dc4e94b6810d3d4b.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div>\u3000<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/99072a0b581190567bd4ff2b8b8ef6b7.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>You can choose from two partners(Only appearance changes)<br>It is also possible to use the 3D model you want<br><br>If you don't have VR equipment, you can play on your desktop like a normal game<br><br><br>*The image was taken when the product was still under development",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/09161c8545da972a42fdf8aa75b94839.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/1d9a96fdc2712da9439a52fcd82a5f49.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>Enjoy a freedom slow life in nature in VR space<br>Live in a log house, and play freely until it's time to go home<br>Enjoy catching insects, fishing, cooking and also communicating with your partner<br>What you can do will increase little by little as the day progresses<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/b58731428e3458637ca12112e18124d3.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>Items and creatures you bring back from exploration will be saved when you place them in your home.<br>You can grow vegetables by finding seeds, taking them home, and planting them in your farm.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/a789f4c49c7b8825dc4e94b6810d3d4b.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div>\u3000<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404330/extras/99072a0b581190567bd4ff2b8b8ef6b7.avif?t=1711984873\" /></div><br>You can choose from two partners(Only appearance changes)<br>It is also possible to use the 3D model you want<br><br>If you don't have VR equipment, you can play on your desktop like a normal game<br><br><br>*The image was taken when the product was still under development",
    "short_description": "Enjoy a stress-free and freedom nature life with your partner. You can catch insects, fish, vegetable farming, cook, etc. It can be played in VR and also on the computer screen",
